<title>USA: TriMas buys German closure manufacturer.</title>
<headline>TriMas buys German closure manufacturer.</headline>
<dateline>ANN ARBOR, Mich. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>TriMas Corp said Thursday it acquired Neunkirchen, Germany-based  Heinrich Stolz GmbH and Co KG, a manufacturer of specialty container closures.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Stolz will complement the European activities of Rieke Corp, a TriMas subsidiary and North America's largest manufacturer of specialty container closures for industrial markets.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
